<title>USA: Olive Branch, Miss., won by J.C. Bradford.</title>
<headline>Olive Branch, Miss., won by J.C. Bradford.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.C. Bradford said it won $3 million of Olive Branch, Miss., combined water and sewer system revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.29 percent.</p>
</text>
